      "title": "Lake Banook",
      "desc": "I do kayaking at Banook every summer and I practice it year round. Like my cottage it does'nt hold one specific memory. I love kayaking it's my favorite sport. sometimes we'll go kayaking long distance and I just get to talk to some of my best friends. I think paddling and Banook is special to me because it's like meditation to me. It's like calming and it helps my brain reset. Photo would'nt load.",
